<div class="gb-element-ba21b9b4 gb-container alignfull">
<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-aac06689">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-9c0f42d6">Announcing d-Matrix Partners with NVIDiA<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">on NVLink Fusion</mark></h2>



<div class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines">NVLink Fusion to connect next-generation d-Matrix XPUs to NVIDIA AI platform Includes NVIDIA Vera, ConnectX-9, BlueField-4 DPU and Spectrum-X Ethernet</div>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-1fc106e1 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn" href=" https://www.d-matrix.ai/announcements/d-matrix-rackscale-nvidia/">Read the Announcement</a>
</div>
</div>


<div class="block--hero bg-dark relative pt-24 mx-break-out px-break-out min-h-[600px] overflow-x-hidden short ">
    <div class="rms-hero-bg rms-hero-bg--desktop" aria-hidden="true">
                    <img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="2560" height="1400" src="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-scaled.webp" class=" rms-hero-bg__image object-cover absolute inset-0 object-center h-full pointer-events-none w-full ar-landscape" alt="hp bg " srcset="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-scaled.webp 2560w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-300x164.webp 300w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-1024x560.webp 1024w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-768x420.webp 768w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-1536x840.webp 1536w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-2048x1120.webp 2048w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hp-bg-2-346x189.webp 346w" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" />            </div>

    
            <div class="rms-hero-bg__overlay rms-hero-bg__overlay--dark-left-bottom" style="--rms-hero-overlay-opacity: 0.69;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="grid lg:grid-rows-3">
                    <div></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col justify-center h-full z-10">
            <h1 class="text-white style--accent leading-none max-lg:[&amp;&gt;br]:hidden text-4xl lg:text-5xl"></h1>
                            <p class="text-subtle max-lg:[&amp;&gt;br]:hidden mt-2"><img decoding="async" class="hero-image reveal reveal-left reveal-delay-1" src="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Infinite-Text.svg" /><br />
<div class="content-wrapper reveal reveal-left reveal-delay-3"><div style="max-width:450px; color:#fff;"><br />
<h1 class="text-white style--accent leading-none"><em class="reveal reveal-left reveal-delay-2 hp-title">NO LATENCY</em></h1></div><br />
<div class="button-wrapper"><a href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/corsair-at-rack-scale/" class="pill-button" target="_blank">Meet Corsair</a><a href="/contact-sales/" class="pill-button" >Contact Sales</a></div></div></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center z-10">
                            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    <div class="h-2.5 bg-accent"></div>



<div class="gb-element-40f44d76 alignfull gb-container">
<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-223dc66b"><div class="gb-container gb-container-46f497a0">

<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-7b3a4faa reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Purpose-built<mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color"> </mark><br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">for the next era of AI</mark></h2>



<p class="gb-headline gb-headline-63f43141 gb-headline-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-3">We’ve redefined silicon architecture with revolutionary memory-centric technology, built to power the next era of AI and the path to superintelligence. Faster, more efficient, and designed to scale without compromise.</p>

</div></div>
</div>


<div class="gb-container gb-container-ca57b75a alignfull gb-container">
<div class="gb-container gb-container-9993486c mobile-padding">
<div class="gb-container gb-container-7caa526b">

<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-64bddf70 reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">The next era of AI<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">demands a new kind<br>of compute.</mark></h2>



<p class="gb-headline gb-headline-2f76bb08 gb-headline-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-3">Inference is exploding, and today’s hardware can’t keep up. The technology that built the brains of AI wasn’t designed to deliver intelligence at the scale the world now demands. We’re confronting that reality head-on, rethinking the architecture from the memory up to make AI faster, more efficient, and built to scale.</p>

</div>
</div>
</div>


<section class="gb-element-ae351e1a gb-container alignfull">
<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-d2ee785e">
<h3 class="gb-text gb-text-4304ceb4 reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">From far, to near,<mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color"> to in.</mark></h3>



<div>
<img decoding="async" width="900" height="710" class="gb-media-c76d15f4 reveal reveal-right reveal-delay-4" alt="" title="chips" src="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chips.webp" srcset="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chips.webp 900w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chips-300x237.webp 300w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chips-768x606.webp 768w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chips-346x273.webp 346w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" />



<p class="gb-headline gb-headline-503d13f3 gb-headline-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-3">We’ve moved compute into memory. <br>d-Matrix works with physics, rather than fighting it, collapsing the distance between memory and compute to accelerate AI inference. <br>Traditional architectures keep compute far from memory. Others have moved it closer. d-Matrix brings compute directly into memory itself, fundamentally changing how data moves and intelligence gets delivered. The result is lower latency, greater efficiency, and a fundamentally better path to scaling inference. The inference crunch is real. We’re innovating<br>our way toward abundance.</p>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-5fa67c78 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-5" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/scaling-ai-inference-with-3dimc/">See how it works</a>
</div>
</div>



<section class="mobile-padding gb-element-8dbf9e9d corsair-section">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-2ce3bcfc">Introducing Corsair™ <br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">Breaking the rules of memory to redefine AI inference</mark></h2>



<div class="gb-element-0e143c32 corsair-section__inner">
<div class="corsair-section__content reveal reveal-up">
<h4 class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Purpose-built for AI inference, Corsair brings high-bandwidth memory and compute together on the same fabric, with an inference-optimized compute<br>engine, high-speed chip-to-chip<br>connectivity, and an industry-standard PCIe form factor.<br>One card. A fundamentally different architecture. Built to scale up and scale out to rack-level systems.</h4>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-9946cfb8 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/corsair-at-rack-scale/">Explore Corsair</a>
</div>



