<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-8b88dc10">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-7187b58f reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Built to stand alone.<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">Built to work with GPUs.</mark></h2>



<div class="gb-element-507feafe">
<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="103" height="306" class="gb-media-6e3d1a37 reveal reveal-left reveal-delay-3" alt="" title="full-rack" src="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/full-rack.webp" srcset="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/full-rack.webp 103w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/full-rack-101x300.webp 101w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 103px) 100vw, 103px" />



<div class="gb-element-fe9e8628">
<h4 class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Deploy Corsair as a complete inference solution for fixed-memory workloads.<br>Pair it with GPUs and put each workload on the architecture best suited to run it.<br>Our pioneering memory-first technology enables offloading fixed-memory tasks<br>and cutting-edge inference techniques to deliver premium user experiences<br>no other product can offer.</h4>



<div class="gb-element-53b71a6d reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-4">
<a class="gb-button gb-button-cd9086e1 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/where-heterogeneous-pipelines-power-an-agentic-coding-future/">Experience Heterogeneous</a>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-225de8f4 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/jetstream-accelerator/">Discover JetStream</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-6629b77a">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-4a2ed682 reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Codesigned with Aviator,<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">our interface for next-generation AI</mark></h2>



<div class="clear-float gb-element-64b2f03a">
<a href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/product/aviator/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1388" height="1372" class="gb-media-aee25ae1 reveal reveal-right reveal-delay-4" alt="" title="aviator-monitor" src="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor.webp" srcset="https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor.webp 1388w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor-300x297.webp 300w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor-1024x1012.webp 1024w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor-768x759.webp 768w, https://www.d-matrix.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/aviator-monitor-346x342.webp 346w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1388px) 100vw, 1388px" /></a>



<h4 class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">The Aviator SDK offers maximum flexibility in inference optimization. From PyTorch-like high level interfaces down to custom kernel execution, we’ve enabled Corsair to achieve the impossible in ultra low-latency, scalable AI inference.</h4>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-d86e7687 gb-button-text d-matrix-btn reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-5" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/product/aviator/">Explore Aviator</a>
</div>
</div>



<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-402b0c30">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-42b94d2a reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">Built to scale,<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">proven in production.</mark></h2>



<div class="clear-float gb-element-7e82b06b">
<h4 class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-3">Our architecture scales from silicon to rack-scale platforms, combining memory-centric compute with next-generation I/O to support the growing complexity of modern AI inference. <br>3DIMC extends that architecture into three dimensions, our roadmap from the world&#8217;s first planar memory-compute substrate to the world&#8217;s first 3D memory-compute substrate at rack scale.</h4>



<div class="red-left-border gb-element-1eaa55ba reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-4">
<div class="gb-element-ffe82e2c">
<p class="gb-text gb-text-ec453e95">3D DRAM</p>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-8c04525d gb-button-text d-matrix-btn" href="https://www.d-matrix.ai/scaling-ai-inference-with-3dimc/">See the performance</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>



<div class="gb-element-3dcf5fc3 gb-container alignfull">
<div class="mobile-padding gb-element-ff095c6f">
<h2 class="gb-text gb-text-1a18852a reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-2">The inference era<br><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)" class="has-inline-color has-accent-color">demands d-Matrix.</mark></h2>



<h4 class="gb-text corsair-section-hp-headlines gb-text-46026ba6 reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-3">We bet on LLMs, agents, and the need for lightning-fast, hyper-efficient inference years before ChatGPT changed the world. From day zero of modern AI, we’ve been building for what comes next. Now, that early conviction is becoming reality. As AI moves from training to intelligence everywhere, d-Matrix is building toward a future where inference is abundant and the next generation of intelligence can take off.</h4>



<div class="gb-element-33baf715">
<p class="gb-text gb-text-b159c8c3 reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-4">Ready to break the memory wall?</p>



<a class="gb-button gb-button-7d36683c gb-button-text d-matrix-btn reveal reveal-up reveal-delay-5" href="/early-access/">Contact Us</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>



